{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57597","headline":"灵宝真一自然太上玄一真人颂一章 · 无名氏","name":"灵宝真一自然太上玄一真人颂一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆妙出洞真，焕烂曜太清。\n奉者号仙人，体无永长生。\n逍遥戏玄虚，宫殿罗无形。\n蒨粲七宝林，晃朗日月精。\n龙鳞交横驰，凤皇翔悲鸣。\n太上治紫台，衆真诵洞经。\n捻香稽首礼，旋行遶宫城。\n三周归高座，道王爲应声。\n人主弘至道，天下普安宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}